    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "4. The present C-482 Application has been filed along with the Compounding Application (IA No. 1 of 2024) supported with affidavits of the petitioner and the respondent no. 2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
